DESCRIPTION:« All Events\n 				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	Dining in the Di
	strict				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n		\n			August 6\n\n	\n\n	  @  \n\n\n6
	:00 PM\n\n		\n\n\n\n	\n	  -  \n\n8:00 PM\n\n\n\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\
	n					\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n									Dining in the District with Co
	uncil Member Wayne MartinJoin City Council Member Wayne Martin for Dining 
	in the District\, a special community gathering celebrating Black Restaura
	nt Week at Oreatha’s At The Point. This event is an opportunity to connect
	 with neighbors\, support local businesses\, and experience one of the dis
	trict’s premier Black-owned restaurants. As we celebrate Black Restaurant 
	Week\, we’re highlighting the entrepreneurs and culinary talent that help 
	strengthen our community and local economy. Guests will enjoy Oreatha’s At
	 The Point’s signature menu of comfort fare with international influences\
	, where Southern hospitality meets bold global flavors in a warm and welco
	ming atmosphere. Whether you’re a longtime resident\, a first-time visitor
	\, or simply looking to support local businesses\, this evening offers the
	 perfect chance to enjoy great food\, meaningful conversation\, and commun
	ity fellowship. Come dine\, connect\, and celebrate Black Restaurant Week 
	while supporting the businesses that make our district thrive. We look for
	ward to seeing you there! 								\n				\n				\n				\n									\n					\n		
